<%# The setup panel's army card, on /play and a match. Locals: board, the
    board's Stimulus identifier; note, an optional sentence read to screen
    readers with Ready; status: true (a match) shows the board's status line
    under the heading (task cyvasse-sidebar-reorder).
    Top to bottom: the heading, the status, Smart Setup beside Ready, then
    the units to place, so Ready is in reach without scrolling past the dock.
    The board sets data-army-mode (smart, fill, new) from how much of the
    army is placed: "smart" fills the Smart Setup button; "fill" and "new"
    leave it hollow and relabel it Place All and New Setup. It keeps one
    place in every mode, so nothing jumps.
    The status here (armyStatus) is a copy, for the eye only, of the board's
    status line, the one live region, which stays put lower in the sidebar
    and is read, not shown, while this card is up; so a placement is
    announced once. The count is for the eye only too, and shows only in the
    phone dock. The sparkle is decoration, hidden from screen readers; one
    wrapping span keeps the space before the words, which a flex button
    would drop between two.
    On a phone the card docks as a sheet under the board during setup
    (game.css, "phone setup dock"): the heading over the count, with a copy
    of a live match's setup clock (armyClock) beside it, every unit, then
    Smart Setup beside Ready at the sheet's foot, in thumb reach. The timer
    card's clock is out of view under the sheet. The copy is for the eye
    only, as the count is. %>
<div class="card p-4 cyvasse-army" data-army-mode="smart" data-<%= board %>-target="army">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted text-center">Your army</h2>
  <p class="sr-only" id="<%= board %>-army-hint">
    Pick a unit, then a lit hex in your five rows. Click a placed unit to move it again. <%= local_assigns[:note] %>
  </p>
  <% if local_assigns[:status] %>
    <p class="cyvasse-army-status text-secondary font-medium" aria-hidden="true" data-<%= board %>-target="armyStatus"></p>
  <% end %>
  <p class="cyvasse-army-count text-sm text-secondary" aria-hidden="true" data-<%= board %>-target="armyCount"></p>
  <span class="cyvasse-army-clock" aria-hidden="true" hidden data-<%= board %>-target="armyClock"></span>
  <button type="button" class="btn cyvasse-smart" data-<%= board %>-target="smartButton"
          data-action="<%= board %>#smartSetup"><span><span aria-hidden="true">✨</span> <span data-smart-label>Smart Setup</span></span></button>
  <button type="button" class="btn cyvasse-ready" disabled aria-describedby="<%= board %>-army-hint"
          data-<%= board %>-target="startButton" data-action="<%= board %>#start">Ready</button>
  <div class="cyvasse-dock" role="group" aria-label="Units to place" aria-describedby="<%= board %>-army-hint"
       data-<%= board %>-target="dock"></div>
</div>
